QuotientGroup__quotientQuotientEquivQuotientAux__app : (a1 : Elem (Subgroup G)) -> (a2 : Elem (Subgroup G)) -> (a3 : Proof (Leq N M)) -> (a4 : Elem (HasQuotient__Quotient (HasQuotient__Quotient G (Subgroup G) N) (Subgroup (HasQuotient__Quotient G (Subgroup G) N)) (Subgroup__map G (HasQuotient__Quotient G (Subgroup G) N) (QuotientGroup__mk' G N) M))) -> Elem (HasQuotient__Quotient G (Subgroup G) M).

