(; doc: The equivalence relation corresponding to the partition of a group by left cosets of a subgroup. ;)
(; //LEAN:QuotientAddGroup.leftRel ;)
QuotientAddGroup__leftRel : (X : Set) -> (s : Elem (AddSubgroup X)) -> Proof (Setoid X).

(; //LEAN:QuotientAddGroup.leftRel_apply ;)
QuotientAddGroup__leftRel_apply : (X : Set) -> (_ : Proof (AddGroup X)) -> (s : Elem (AddSubgroup X)) -> (x1 : Elem X) -> (y : Elem X) -> Proof (iff (Setoid__r X x1 y) (Membership__mem X (AddSubgroup X) s (plus (Neg__neg X x1) y))).

(; doc: An `AddGroup` homomorphism `φ : G →+ M` with `N ⊆ ker(φ)` descends (i.e. `lift`s) to an `AddGroup` homomorphism `G/N →+ M`. ;)
