(; doc: A surjective `AddGroup` homomorphism `φ : G →+ H` with `N = ker(φ)` descends (i.e. `lift`s) to an `AddGroup` isomorphism `G/N ≃+ H`. ;)
(; //LEAN:QuotientAddGroup.liftEquiv ;)
