(; doc: An `AddGroup` homomorphism `f : G →+ H` induces a map `G/N →+ H/M` if `N ⊆ f⁻¹(M)`. ;)
(; //LEAN:QuotientAddGroup.map ;)
QuotientAddGroup__map : (G : Set) -> (H : Set) -> (N : Elem (AddSubgroup G)) -> (M : Elem (AddSubgroup H)) -> (f : Elem (AddMonoidHom G H)) -> (h1 : Proof (Leq N (AddSubgroup__comap G H f M))) -> Elem (AddMonoidHom (HasQuotient__Quotient G (AddSubgroup G) N) (HasQuotient__Quotient H (AddSubgroup H) M)).

(; doc: The canonical map from an `AddGroup` `α` to the quotient `α ⧸ s`. ;)
