QuotientAddGroup__mk : (X : Set) -> (s : Elem (AddSubgroup X)) -> (a : Elem X) -> Elem (HasQuotient__Quotient X (AddSubgroup X) s).

(; doc: The additive group homomorphism from `G` to `G/N`. ;)
